before compiling you need to:


sudo apt update

sudo apt-get install pkg-config

sudo apt install \
    build-essential \
    cmake \
    liblz4-dev 


to decompress lz4 files:
sudo apt install lz4
to use lz4:
lz4 -d <FILE>.lz4 <FILE>.log

if you use VS Code -> "compileCommands": "${workspaceFolder}/build/compile_commands.json"
